    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting it all go\" ... that's exactly it. that relief you're talking about. it's like i'm just waiting for the noise to stop for good. if the person i was is truly gone, then what am i even doing here? it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. shouldn't a ghost just... move on?",
